# Call-site ledger of face_classification at 2f152a227c528567924fa1c7587a2e6b8eb43309.
# See macro-benchmark/README.md for the conventions and
# face_classification.md for the judgements (referred to by number below).
#
# An application: seven scripts and three packages under src/, which import
# each other as top-level modules. No trace: the ground truth comes from
# reading only. Ordinary unavailable-library operations retain imported
# attribute/call paths; their results do not establish concrete classes.
# REQUIREMENTS.txt pins and the Dockerfile's unpinned installations both
# contribute admitted configurations; the commit date is not a version cap.
# Actual decorators applied to package definitions use the narrow
# definition-time exception. Untyped client objects remain opaque (B5).
# Apart from their explicit constructors, package classes define no special
# methods, properties or metaclasses; every required site is explicit.

